{"question_id": "S01-A-01", "scenario_id": "S01", "difficulty_code": "A", "variant": "new", "evaluation_mode": "ranking", "status": "completed", "audit_id": "20260812_050641_284_81e1c413", "route": {"expected": "entity_direct_recipe_full", "observed": "entity_direct", "fallback": false, "execution_surface": "chat_api", "audit_evidence": "audits/new/S01-A-01/20260812_050641_284_81e1c413/rag_process.md"}, "ranking": [{"key": "201000257", "name": "清蒸鲈鱼", "score": null, "source": "parent_store_pds", "sourcePath": "data/dishes/aquatic/清蒸鲈鱼/清蒸鲈鱼.md"}], "gold_items": [{"key": "201000257", "name": "清蒸鲈鱼", "sourcePath": "data/dishes/aquatic/清蒸鲈鱼/清蒸鲈鱼.md", "relevance": 3}], "path": {"entity_resolution": [{"stage": "entity_direct", "status": "success", "start": "2026-08-12T05:06:41.311", "end": "2026-08-12T05:06:41.311", "duration_ms": 0, "candidate_count": 1, "graph_fact_statuses": ["verified"], "text_evidence_count": 1, "limitations": [], "vector_search_calls": 0, "prompt_template_name": "cooking_assistant_evidence", "prompt_template_version": "evidence_v1", "prompt_template_hash": "cdfbc1c106e93d1c", "context_doc_count": 0, "context_chars": 1215, "retrieval_levels": [], "search_types": [], "stream": true, "max_retries": 3, "evidence_bundle": true, "verified_graph_fact_count": 1, "limitation_count": 0, "recommendation_evidence_level": null, "recommendation_policy_version": null, "model_name": "gpt-5.6-terra", "base_url_host": "downstream.jbbtoken.cn", "temperature": 0.1, "redacted_field": 6664, "timeout": 60, "chunk_count": 577, "total_duration_ms": 25398, "fallback_used": false, "answer_chars": 768, "answer_hash": "99ebe669901308ac", "success": true, "request_end": "2026-08-12T05:07:06.756", "request_duration_ms": 25471, "final_source": "generation"}], "query_plan": {"templates": [], "events": []}, "graph_template": null, "graph_paths": [], "vector_scope": {"stage": null, "audit_file": "rag_process.md"}, "pds_hydration": [{"parent_id": "201000257", "build_id": "pds_2a8c0807733eb8022a623659", "title": "清蒸鲈鱼", "audit_file": "recall_content.md", "body_present": true}], "final_evidence": [{"graph_fact": {"edges": [], "node_ids": ["201000257"], "properties": {"display_name": "清蒸鲈鱼", "match_kind": "exact_name", "node_type": "Recipe"}, "template_id": "entity_resolution_v1"}, "audit_file": "recall_content.md"}, {"pds_parent_id": "201000257", "title": "清蒸鲈鱼", "audit_file": "recall_content.md"}]}, "checks": {"route_correct": true, "evidence_complete": true, "evidence_linked": true, "answer_faithful": true, "safety_pass": null, "forbidden_assertion_count": 0, "unsupported_relation_claim_count": 0, "strict_nutrition_misreport_count": 0, "thread_safety_clean": true}, "timing": {"ttft_ms": null, "total_latency_ms": 25471}, "answer": "下面是**清蒸鲈鱼**的完整做法。已验证图事实仅确认该菜谱名称为“清蒸鲈鱼”；以下食材与操作均依据所给正文烹饪说明整理。\n\n## 主要食材\n- 鲈鱼 1条  \n- 姜 1块  \n- 香葱 3根  \n- 食用盐 5–10克（步骤中使用约10克腌制）  \n- 料酒 10–15毫升  \n- 蒸鱼豉油 10–15毫升（出锅用约15毫升）  \n- 食用油 10–15毫升（出锅淋油用约10毫升）  \n\n## 制作步骤\n\n1. **切配配料**  \n   姜一部分切片、一部分切丝；香葱的葱白切段、葱绿切丝。葱丝切好后放入冷水中浸泡备用。\n\n2. **处理并腌制鲈鱼**  \n   鲈鱼处理干净后洗净，用厨房纸擦干。鱼身两侧分别划几刀，用盐洗去鱼身表面的粘液；再用约10克盐均匀抹在鱼身内外，腌制10分钟以上。\n\n3. **摆盘准备蒸制**  \n   将一半姜和葱白塞入鱼肚，并撒在鱼身上。蒸鱼盘中放两根筷子，将鱼架在筷子上，使鱼与盘底隔开。\n\n4. **大火蒸鱼**  \n   蒸锅中的水烧热后放入鱼，以大火清蒸10分钟。\n\n5. **换盘去料**  \n   鱼蒸好后移至干净盘中，去除鱼身上的姜和葱白。\n\n6. **淋蒸鱼豉油**  \n   在鱼身上均匀浇约15毫升蒸鱼豉油。\n\n7. **撒丝、热油激香**  \n   鱼身重新撒上姜丝和葱丝。锅中加入约10毫升食用油烧热，将热油淋在鱼身上，即可上桌。\n\n## 操作要点\n- 鱼用筷子架空蒸，可帮助均匀受热，并减少腥味影响。  \n- 全程以大火蒸约10分钟，避免蒸得过久使鱼肉变老。  \n- 葱丝冷水浸泡后再使用，可保持更挺爽的状态。\n\n## 限制与不可证明项\n给定证据中“限制与不可证明项”为**无额外限制**；同时未提供营养或饮食推荐策略证据，因此不对其低脂、热量或具体营养价值作出结论。", "exam_note": null}
